# folio — environment template (endpoints only).
# NEVER put real secrets or figures here. Figures live in the OneDrive .me vault.

# --- AI layer (optional) ---
# Prefer a LOCAL model for anything that touches raw figures:
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434

# Cloud LLMs may be used ONLY for figure-free explanation/synthesis.
# Provide real keys via the OS keychain at runtime, not in this file.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Market data (public, figure-free: prices / NAVs only) ---
# ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=
# MARKET_DATA_BASE_URL=

# --- Local data location (kept OUTSIDE git; do not commit) ---
# Path to your local portfolio DB / ledger (in the .me vault or local app data):
# FOLIO_DATA_PATH=
